    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Leinster Property are delighted to present new to the market this impressive 4 bed detached AO zero-emission home featuring exceptionally high energy performance.  The property combines every possible modern convenience you would expect for your everyday needs, all presented in this superb property.  \r\n\r\nOriginally a 1940's cottage, the overall property now forms part of a complete new build, having been tastefully extended and transformed by the current owners, this property offers a luxurious finish inside and out and will appeal to a discerning owner seeking a place to call home. \r\n\r\nDuncreevan offers a peaceful rural location, yet less than 5 minutes drive Kilcock town, including some wonderful amenities nearby, such as the Royal Canal Greenway and Donadea Forest Park.  \r\n\r\nExcellent selection of local public transport nearby with Kilcock Train station, the M4 motorway and regular bus service offering ease of connectivity to Dublin city, Airport and surrounding counties.  Maynooth University and town are a short distance away also.  Clongowes College and Naas Millennium Business Park are within easy reach.\r\n\r\nThe property is situated on circa 0.6 acres of landscaped gardens and is not overlooked over total privacy.  Some of the features include automatic entrance gates, detached garage of c.40sq.m.  Bespoke solid oak hand painted kitchen, and herring bone solid oak floors throughout the ground floor.  Solar panels fitted x 10 complete with 5kw battery, dual Samsung heat pump with digital stats in each room.  \r\n\r\nWith so much on offer this property really has that standout wow factor and needs to be viewed to be fully appreciated."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "The accommodation in brief consists of entrance hall with boot room area complimented with a handmade wardrobe space, Herring Bone solid oak floor fitted, leading to living room off, complete with solid Oak floor, wall mounted lights and two large picture windows offering views of the landscaped garden and mature trees.\r\n\r\nThe kitchen/family room is situated to the right of the entrance hall and doesn't fail to impress, it offers a large American style kitchen layout out with plenty of space for dining also.  The kitchen comes with a Bespoke handmade units complete with hand painted cabinet doors finished in Farrow and Ball Charleston grey.    The countertops are finished in Calacatta Gold stone.  Neff appliances are included also with a smart fridge, hob, oven and dishwasher.  \r\n\r\nVelux windows above the breakfast bar offer wonderful additional natural light, fitted with rain sensors and combined with ceiling electric fan also, they combine to almost create a natural aircon system.  Double French doors off the kitchen open to the rear garden and patio with granite pavers nicely spaced around Donegal quartz stone chipping.\r\n\r\nAdditional ground floor accommodation offer two large double size bedrooms each with feature wall complete with built in wardrobes/storage.  The bedrooms come with solid Oak Herring Bone flooring and wonderful views of the garden.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor is complimented with a large downstairs bathroom complete with shower, whb with vanity mirror with integrated light and wc.  The bathroom comes with tiled floors and splash back.  Additional storage in the bathroom also with inset door offering understairs storage.\r\n\r\nUpstairs provides a large bright landing with storage space off, fitted carpets also.\r\n\r\nThe two bedrooms are a good size doubles with master bedroom complete with walk in wardrobe and ensuite bathroom also.\r\n\r\nThe family bathroom comes complete with a full white suite, additional shower, vanity mirror with integrated light and under sink storage, wc, tiled floor and splash back also\r\n\r\nOutside:\r\n\r\nLarge driveway with Donegal quartz stone chipping provides plenty of off-street parking.  The gardens extend to circa 0.6 acres with new lawn seeded.  The garden offers plenty of privacy and offers a blank canvas for avid gardens.\r\n\r\nDetached garage of circa 40sq.m comes with electric roller shutter and plenty of storage for all your extras including garden equipment.\r\nThe property is nicely positioned off a quiet country road and full bordered with mature trees, shrubs and automatic gated for added security."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Features and additional details\r\n\r\n4 Bed extended 1940’s original cottage now offered as AO BER Rated stylish home\r\n\r\nMains water supply\r\n\r\nModern domestic waste water treatment system, offering a fully self-contained property\r\n\r\nOverall internal area c.2700 sq.ft (251sq.m)\r\n\r\nDetached garage c.40 sq.m (430sq.ft) complete with roller shutter (remote control option) and power supply and exterior water tap\r\n\r\nOverall site c. 0.6 acres \r\n\r\nNicely landscaped gardens with electric automatic gated entrance \r\n\r\nFront boundary complimented with mature trees and hedgerow\r\n\r\nPicket and post boundary fencing\r\n\r\nBespoke solid oak kitchen hand painted and utility room also\r\n\r\nSolid oak Herring bone flooring runs throughout the ground floor\r\n\r\nKitchen comes complete with full range of Neff appliances including smart fridge freezer\r\n\r\nCalacatta gold worktops fitted\r\n\r\nVelux windows with rain sensors and ceiling fan in kitchen/dining room\r\n\r\nFully carpets upstairs in each of the three additional bedrooms\r\n\r\nSolar panels x 10 fitted including 5 kw battery for storage with option to expand if needed\r\n\r\nDual Samsung heat pump with 3 zones, complete with underfloor heating downstairs\r\n\r\nDigital control heating stats in each room\r\n\r\nHeat recovery and ventilation system installed\r\n\r\nCCTV system complete with 8 cameras and option to operate via App system\r\n\r\nFully alarmed with option to avail of monitored system\r\n\r\nTriple glazed windows and doors throughout \r\n\r\nLow maintenance exterior complimented with pressed metal surrounds finished in graphite grey\r\n\r\nMature laurel hedge planted, with new lawns laid complimented with additional raised beds with mature shrubs planted along the side of driveway \r\nentrance\r\n\r\nDriveway laid out with Donegal quartz chippings and select granite paving stones situated around patio area\r\n\r\nEntrance gates fully automatic and powder coated for low maintenance \r\n\r\nExternal door lights\r\n\r\nStira staircase for additional ease of access to attic storage area\r\n\r\nElectric car charger cables in place"
      },
      {
